{title: Véngase II}
{artist: Rawayana}
{year: 2016}
{key: Em}
{time: 4/4}

{define: Em base-fret 1 frets 0 4 0 2}
{define: F#m base-fret 1 frets 2 1 2 0}
{define: G base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 2}
{define: A base-fret 1 frets 2 1 0 0}
{define: B base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 2}
{define: Cmaj7 base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 2}
{define: C# base-fret 4 frets 3 2 1 1}
{define: Eb base-fret 1 frets 0 3 3 1}
{define: Dm base-fret 1 frets 2 2 1 0}
{define: Gm base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 1}
{define: C base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 3}
{define: D base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 0}
{define: Fm base-fret 1 frets 1 0 1 3}
{define: Ab base-fret 3 frets 3 1 2 1}

[Em]·  · · · | [F#m]·   · · · | [Em]·  · · · | [F#m]·   · · ·

[Em]Vengo del Caribe, esa es la ver[F#m]daaad, ooh
[Em] Y la receta de mi canción, lle[F#m]va calor y humedad

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
